		<h1 id="ctl00_MainContent_TitleContainer" class="item-description-title">
			Meetings
		</h1>
		<div id="ctl00_MainContent_DescriptionContainer" class="item-description">
			<p>The City of Sonoma has a variety of committees that are working constantly to serve you better. Below is a description of each of our committees, as well as recent meetings that you can review. Click on the name of a specific meeting to review the details.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Any material distributed to a majority of a legislative body within 72 hours of the meeting it pertains to, will be made available on the <a href="https://www.sonomacity.org/materials-distributed-after-agenda-posted/">Subsequent Meeting Material</a> page for public review.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>PUBLIC NOTICES: At times a noticed Public Hearing will be cancelled or continued.&nbsp; Please visit our&nbsp;<a href="https://www.sonomacity.org/public-notices/">Public Notice</a>&nbsp;page for notices.</strong><br /></p>
		</div>
		<input name="ctl00$MainContent$SummaryHidden" type="hidden" id="ctl00_MainContent_SummaryHidden" />
		<div id="orderSaveMessage" style="font-size: 0.5em;"></div>
	</div>

	<div id="ctl00_MainContent_MeetingTypeContainer" class="list-content">
		
				<div id="ctl00_MainContent_MeetingTypeRepeater_ctl00_ItemTemplate" class="item-template">
					<div id="ctl00_MainContent_MeetingTypeRepeater_ctl00_MeetingTypeLLabel">
						<div class="item-title meeting-type-title">
							<div class="admin-buttons meeting-type-edit-button">
								
							</div>
							<h2>
								<a href="/Portal/MeetingInformation.aspx?type=16" id="ctl00_MainContent_MeetingTypeRepeater_ctl00_Title" class="meeting-type-item-title" style="color: #fff;">Planning Commission</a>
								
							</h2>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="meeting-type-item item-content" style="padding-bottom: 0 !important">
						<div class="meeting-type-item-description item-description portal-item-description">
							<p>The Planning commission prepares, revises and implements the comprehensive long-term General Plan for the physical development of the City and surrounding areas.  It conducts hearings and makes decisions and/or recommendations on a variety of land use applications.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>The commission meets at 6:00 p.m. on the third Thursday of each month at the City Council Chambers, 177 First Street West, Sonoma.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>For questions regarding the Planning Commission, please contact the <a href="http://https://www.sonomacity.org/departments/planning/">Community Development</a> department, <a href="mailto:planning@sonomacity.org">planning@sonomacity.org</a>.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><a href="https://sonomacity.civicweb.net/filepro/documents/3656" target="_blank">Agendas prior to 2017</a></p>
						</div>
						<div id="ctl00_MainContent_MeetingTypeRepeater_ctl00_MeetingLinks" class="meeting-type-links item-description">
							<ol id="ctl00_MainContent_MeetingTypeRepeater_ctl00_MeetingLinksList" style="margin-top:1em;">
							<li style="position:relative;padding-right:15px;"><span class="list-custom-bullet-document background-color"></span><a class="list-link" href="/Portal/MeetingInformation.aspx?Id=8460">Planning Commission - 15 Oct 2026</a><em class="video-event glyphicon glyphicon-facetime-video" date-id="8460" aria-label="Includes Video" style="position:absolute;right:0px;top:5px;margin:0 0 0 0.4em;text-indent:0em;"></em></li><li style="position:relative;padding-right:15px;"><span class="list-custom-bullet-document background-color"></span><a class="list-link" href="/Portal/MeetingInformation.aspx?Id=8459">Planning Commission - 17 Sep 2026</a><em class="video-event glyphicon glyphicon-facetime-video" date-id="8459" aria-label="Includes Video" style="position:absolute;right:0px;top:5px;margin:0 0 0 0.4em;text-indent:0em;"></em></li><li style="position:relative;padding-right:15px;"><span class="list-custom-bullet-document background-color"></span><a class="list-link" href="/Portal/MeetingInformation.aspx?Id=8458">Planning Commission - 18 Aug 2026</a><em class="video-event glyphicon glyphicon-facetime-video" date-id="8458" aria-label="Includes Video" style="position:absolute;right:0px;top:5px;margin:0 0 0 0.4em;text-indent:0em;"></em></li></ol>
						</div>

					</div>
					<div style="display: inline-block; width: 95%; position: absolute; right: 10px; bottom: 10px;">
						
						<a href="/portal/members.aspx?id=16" id="ctl00_MainContent_MeetingTypeRepeater_ctl00_MembersLink" class="button background-color-hover members-button" aria-label="Planning Commission Members">Members</a>
					</div>
					<input type="hidden" name="ctl00$MainContent$MeetingTypeRepeater$ctl00$MeetingTypePortalItemId" id="ctl00_MainContent_MeetingTypeRepeater_ctl00_MeetingTypePortalItemId" value="3653" />
				</div>
			
				<div id="ctl00_MainContent_MeetingTypeRepeater_ctl01_ItemTemplate" class="item-template">
					<div id="ctl00_MainContent_MeetingTypeRepeater_ctl01_MeetingTypeLLabel">
						<div class="item-title meeting-type-title">
							<div class="admin-buttons meeting-type-edit-button">
								
							</div>
							<h2>
								<a href="/Portal/MeetingInformation.aspx?type=10" id="ctl00_MainContent_MeetingTypeRepeater_ctl01_Title" class="meeting-type-item-title" style="color: #fff;">City Council</a>
								
							</h2>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="meeting-type-item item-content" style="padding-bottom: 0 !important">
						<div class="meeting-type-item-description item-description portal-item-description">
							<p>Sonoma operates under the the Council/Manager form of government. The City Council is the elected body that oversees all municipal operations. The City Council provides policy leadership and acts as the legislative arm of City government.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>City Council normally meets at 6:00 p.m., on the first and third Wednesday of each month.  Meetings are held in the Community Meeting Room at 177 First Street West, Sonoma California. City Council meetings are broadcast live on Sonoma TV Channel 27 and streamed live on their <a href="http://www.svtv27.com/svtv-live-stream/" target="_blank">website</a>. Archived video can be viewed <a href="http://www.svtv27.com/on-demand/" target="_blank">here</a>.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For questions regarding the City Council, please contact the City Clerk's Office, <a href="mailto:cityhall@sonomacity.org">cityhall@sonomacity.org</a>.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href="https://sonomacity.civicweb.net/Portal/MeetingInformation.aspx?Id=73" target="_blank">2017 Agendas &amp; Minutes</a></p><p><a href="https://sonomacity.civicweb.net/filepro/documents/1021" target="_blank">Agendas prior to 2017</a></p><p><a href="https://sonomacity.civicweb.net/filepro/documents/4345" target="_blank">Minutes prior to 2017</a></p>
						</div>
						<div id="ctl00_MainContent_MeetingTypeRepeater_ctl01_MeetingLinks" class="meeting-type-links item-description">
							<ol id="ctl00_MainContent_MeetingTypeRepeater_ctl01_MeetingLinksList" style="margin-top:1em;">
							<li style="position:relative;"><span class="list-custom-bullet-document background-color"></span><a class="list-link" href="/Portal/MeetingInformation.aspx?Id=8481">CANCELLED - City Council - 04 Nov 2026</a></li><li style="position:relative;padding-right:15px;"><span class="list-custom-bullet-document background-color"></span><a class="list-link" href="/Portal/MeetingInformation.aspx?Id=8480">City Council - 21 Oct 2026</a><em class="video-event glyphicon glyphicon-facetime-video" date-id="8480" aria-label="Includes Video" style="position:absolute;right:0px;top:5px;margin:0 0 0 0.4em;text-indent:0em;"></em></li><li style="position:relative;padding-right:15px;"><span class="list-custom-bullet-document background-color"></span><a class="list-link" href="/Portal/MeetingInformation.aspx?Id=8479">City Council - 07 Oct 2026</a><em class="video-event glyphicon glyphicon-facetime-video" date-id="8479" aria-label="Includes Video" style="position:absolute;right:0px;top:5px;margin:0 0 0 0.4em;text-indent:0em;"></em></li></ol>
						</div>

					</div>
					<div style="display: inline-block; width: 95%; position: absolute; right: 10px; bottom: 10px;">
						
						<a href="/portal/members.aspx?id=10" id="ctl00_MainContent_MeetingTypeRepeater_ctl01_MembersLink" class="button background-color-hover members-button" aria-label="City Council Members">Members</a>
					</div>
					<input type="hidden" name="ctl00$MainContent$MeetingTypeRepeater$ctl01$MeetingTypePortalItemId" id="ctl00_MainContent_MeetingTypeRepeater_ctl01_MeetingTypePortalItemId" value="1633" />
				</div>
			
				<div id="ctl00_MainContent_MeetingTypeRepeater_ctl02_ItemTemplate" class="item-template">
					<div id="ctl00_MainContent_MeetingTypeRepeater_ctl02_MeetingTypeLLabel">
						<div class="item-title meeting-type-title">
							<div class="admin-buttons meeting-type-edit-button">
								
							</div>
							<h2>
								<a href="/Portal/MeetingInformation.aspx?type=47" id="ctl00_MainContent_MeetingTypeRepeater_ctl02_Title" class="meeting-type-item-title" style="color: #fff;">Special City Council</a>
								
							</h2>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="meeting-type-item item-content" style="padding-bottom: 0 !important">
						<div class="meeting-type-item-description item-description portal-item-description">
							<p><span style="background-color: #dfe2ea; color: #646567;">A Special Council meeting is a meeting called in addition to the  Regular scheduled meetings and can be a meeting that is open or closed to the public. Special meetings are called for consideration of a specific item.&nbsp;</span></p>
<p><span style="background-color: #dfe2ea; color: #646567;">&nbsp;</span></p>
<p><span style="background-color: #dfe2ea; color: #646567;">A 24 hour notice period is required for Council to conduct a Special meeting, however, the notice will be given as early as possible. </span></p>
						</div>
						<div id="ctl00_MainContent_MeetingTypeRepeater_ctl02_MeetingLinks" class="meeting-type-links item-description">
							<ol id="ctl00_MainContent_MeetingTypeRepeater_ctl02_MeetingLinksList" style="margin-top:1em;">
