				<div id="ctl00_MainContent_MeetingTypeRepeater_ctl04_ItemTemplate" class="item-template">
					<div id="ctl00_MainContent_MeetingTypeRepeater_ctl04_MeetingTypeLLabel">
						<div class="item-title meeting-type-title">
							<div class="admin-buttons meeting-type-edit-button">
								
							</div>
							<h2>
								<a href="/Portal/MeetingInformation.aspx?type=58" id="ctl00_MainContent_MeetingTypeRepeater_ctl04_Title" class="meeting-type-item-title" style="color: #fff;">Climate Action Commission</a>
								
							</h2>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="meeting-type-item item-content" style="padding-bottom: 0 !important">
						<div class="meeting-type-item-description item-description portal-item-description">
							<p>The climate action commission shall serve as a technical advisory commission regarding matters related to climate action. It shall advise the city council on issues related to reducing greenhouse gasses from the city's municipal, residential, commercial, and industrial sectors and on adapting to climate change within the city&rsquo;s jurisdiction.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>For questions regarding the CAC, please contact Jennifer Gates, Community Development Director,&nbsp;<a href="mailto:JGates@sonomacity.org">JGates@sonomacity.org</a>.</p>
						</div>
						<div id="ctl00_MainContent_MeetingTypeRepeater_ctl04_MeetingLinks" class="meeting-type-links item-description">
							<ol id="ctl00_MainContent_MeetingTypeRepeater_ctl04_MeetingLinksList" style="margin-top:1em;">
							<li style="position:relative;padding-right:15px;"><span class="list-custom-bullet-document background-color"></span><a class="list-link" href="/Portal/MeetingInformation.aspx?Id=8451">Climate Action Commission - 10 Nov 2026</a><em class="video-event glyphicon glyphicon-facetime-video" date-id="8451" aria-label="Includes Video" style="position:absolute;right:0px;top:5px;margin:0 0 0 0.4em;text-indent:0em;"></em></li><li style="position:relative;padding-right:15px;"><span class="list-custom-bullet-document background-color"></span><a class="list-link" href="/Portal/MeetingInformation.aspx?Id=8531">Special Climate Action Commission - 14 Oct 2026</a><em class="video-event glyphicon glyphicon-facetime-video" date-id="8531" aria-label="Includes Video" style="position:absolute;right:0px;top:5px;margin:0 0 0 0.4em;text-indent:0em;"></em></li><li style="position:relative;padding-right:15px;"><span class="list-custom-bullet-document background-color"></span><a class="list-link" href="/Portal/MeetingInformation.aspx?Id=8486">Climate Action Commission - 12 Aug 2026</a><em class="video-event glyphicon glyphicon-facetime-video" date-id="8486" aria-label="Includes Video" style="position:absolute;right:0px;top:5px;margin:0 0 0 0.4em;text-indent:0em;"></em></li></ol>
