							</div>
							<h2>
								<a href="/Portal/MeetingInformation.aspx?type=17" id="ctl00_MainContent_MeetingTypeRepeater_ctl06_Title" class="meeting-type-item-title" style="color: #fff;">Historic Preservation Commission</a>
								
							</h2>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="meeting-type-item item-content" style="padding-bottom: 0 !important">
						<div class="meeting-type-item-description item-description portal-item-description">
							<p>The goal of the Historic Preservation Commission is to protect the architectural heritage of Sonoma and promote excellence in town design. Previously named the Design Review &amp; Historic Preservation Commission.<br />
<br />
It meets at 6:00 p.m. on the second Tuesday of each month at the Community Meeting Room, 177 First Street West, Sonoma.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><a href="https://sonomacity.civicweb.net/filepro/documents/6229" target="_blank">View Agendas</a></p>
<p><a href="https://sonomacity.civicweb.net/filepro/documents/5424" target="_blank">View Minutes</a></p>
						</div>
						<div id="ctl00_MainContent_MeetingTypeRepeater_ctl06_MeetingLinks" class="meeting-type-links item-description">
							<ol id="ctl00_MainContent_MeetingTypeRepeater_ctl06_MeetingLinksList" style="margin-top:1em;">
