							<h2>
								<a href="/Portal/MeetingInformation.aspx?type=57" id="ctl00_MainContent_MeetingTypeRepeater_ctl07_Title" class="meeting-type-item-title" style="color: #fff;">Parks, Recreation, and Open Space Commission</a>
								
							</h2>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="meeting-type-item item-content" style="padding-bottom: 0 !important">
						<div class="meeting-type-item-description item-description portal-item-description">
							<p>The Parks, Recreation, and Open Space Commission advises the City&nbsp;Council on matters related to the preservation and enhancement of the parks, recreational facilities, and open space under the jurisdiction of the city.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>For questions regarding the PROSC, please contact the <a href="http://https://www.sonomacity.org/departments/public-works/">Public Works</a> department, <a href="mailto:publicworks@sonomacity.org">publicworks@sonomacity.org</a>.</p>
						</div>
						<div id="ctl00_MainContent_MeetingTypeRepeater_ctl07_MeetingLinks" class="meeting-type-links item-description">
