						<div class="item-title meeting-type-title">
							<div class="admin-buttons meeting-type-edit-button">
								
							</div>
							<h2>
								<a href="/Portal/MeetingInformation.aspx?type=20" id="ctl00_MainContent_MeetingTypeRepeater_ctl08_Title" class="meeting-type-item-title" style="color: #fff;">Traffic Safety Committee</a>
								
							</h2>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="meeting-type-item item-content" style="padding-bottom: 0 !important">
						<div class="meeting-type-item-description item-description portal-item-description">
							<p>The Traffic Safety Committee reviews proposed solutions to neighborhood traffic safety issues by City residents.  It advises the City Council on physical improvements proposed as solutions to those issues.<br />
<br />
To have a particular traffic safety issue reviewed, please download and complete a <a href="https://storage.googleapis.com/proudcity/sonomaca/uploads/2018/07/Traffic-Hazard-Reporting-Form-1.pdf">Traffic Hazard Reporting Form.</a></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>For questions regarding the TSC, please contact the <a href="http://https://www.sonomacity.org/departments/public-works/">Public Works</a> department, <a href="mailto:publicworks@sonomacity.org">publicworks@sonomacity.org</a>.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><a href="https://sonomacity.civicweb.net/filepro/documents/5428" target="_blank">View Agendas</a></p>
<p><a href="https://sonomacity.civicweb.net/filepro/documents/5429" target="_blank">View Minutes</a></p>
						</div>
						<div id="ctl00_MainContent_MeetingTypeRepeater_ctl08_MeetingLinks" class="meeting-type-links item-description">
