							</div>
							<h2>
								<a href="/Portal/MeetingInformation.aspx?type=49" id="ctl00_MainContent_MeetingTypeRepeater_ctl10_Title" class="meeting-type-item-title" style="color: #fff;">Oversight Board to the Dissolved Sonoma Community Development Agency </a>
								
							</h2>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="meeting-type-item item-content" style="padding-bottom: 0 !important">
						<div class="meeting-type-item-description item-description portal-item-description">
							The City of Sonoma began serving as the Successor Agency to the Sonoma Community Development Agency on February 1, 2012 under a new State law, Assembly Bill 1X 26, which was upheld by the Supreme Court on December 29, 2011. The Successor Agency is governed by a seven-member Oversight Board. Meetings of the Oversight Board will be open to the public and noticed under the Brown Act.
						</div>
						<div id="ctl00_MainContent_MeetingTypeRepeater_ctl10_MeetingLinks" class="meeting-type-links item-description">
							<ol id="ctl00_MainContent_MeetingTypeRepeater_ctl10_MeetingLinksList" style="margin-top:1em;">
							<li style="position:relative;"><span class="list-custom-bullet-document background-color"></span><a class="list-link" href="/Portal/MeetingInformation.aspx?Id=219">Oversight Board to the Dissolved Sonoma Community Development Agency  - 25 Jan 2018</a></li></ol>
						</div>

					</div>
					<div style="display: inline-block; width: 95%; position: absolute; right: 10px; bottom: 10px;">
						
						
					</div>
					<input type="hidden" name="ctl00$MainContent$MeetingTypeRepeater$ctl10$MeetingTypePortalItemId" id="ctl00_MainContent_MeetingTypeRepeater_ctl10_MeetingTypePortalItemId" value="11252" />
				</div>
			
				<div id="ctl00_MainContent_MeetingTypeRepeater_ctl11_ItemTemplate" class="item-template">
					<div id="ctl00_MainContent_MeetingTypeRepeater_ctl11_MeetingTypeLLabel">
						<div class="item-title meeting-type-title">
							<div class="admin-buttons meeting-type-edit-button">
								
							</div>
							<h2>
								<a href="/Portal/MeetingInformation.aspx?type=22" id="ctl00_MainContent_MeetingTypeRepeater_ctl11_Title" class="meeting-type-item-title" style="color: #fff;">Sonoma Valley Community Advisory Committee</a>
								
							</h2>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="meeting-type-item item-content" style="padding-bottom: 0 !important">
						<div class="meeting-type-item-description item-description portal-item-description">
							<p>The Sonoma Valley Community Advisory Commission (formerly the Sonoma Valley Citizens Advisory Commission) was created through a Joint Powers Agreement between the County of Sonoma and the City of Sonoma.  Its purpose is to provide a public forum to deliberate planning decisions impacting both the City of Sonoma and the unincorporated areas of the Sonoma Valley. <br /><br />The commission consists of eleven commissioners, three alternates, two emeritus, and two ex-officio members.  The City of Sonoma appoints and is represented on the commission by three commissioners, one alternate and one Council member, Planning Commissioner, or Planning staff member.<br /><br />The SVCAC meets on the fourth Wednesday of most months, 6:30 pm, in the Sonoma Council Chambers, 177 First Street West.  County staff, through Supervisor Rebecca Hermosillo's office, prepare the agendas and materials for the meetings.  For information contact Betzy Chavez, Betzy.Chavez@sonomacounty.gov, (707) 565-2241.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href="https://sonomacity.civicweb.net/filepro/documents/5421" target="_blank">View Agendas</a></p><p><a href="https://sonomacity.civicweb.net/filepro/documents/5422" target="_blank">View Minutes</a></p>
						</div>
						<div id="ctl00_MainContent_MeetingTypeRepeater_ctl11_MeetingLinks" class="meeting-type-links item-description">
							<ol id="ctl00_MainContent_MeetingTypeRepeater_ctl11_MeetingLinksList" style="margin-top:1em;">
							<li style="position:relative;"><span class="list-custom-bullet-document background-color"></span><a class="list-link" href="/Portal/MeetingInformation.aspx?Id=8532">Sonoma Valley Community Advisory Committee - 28 Oct 2026</a></li><li style="position:relative;"><span class="list-custom-bullet-document background-color"></span><a class="list-link" href="/Portal/MeetingInformation.aspx?Id=8529">Sonoma Valley Community Advisory Committee - 23 Sep 2026</a></li><li style="position:relative;"><span class="list-custom-bullet-document background-color"></span><a class="list-link" href="/Portal/MeetingInformation.aspx?Id=8514">Sonoma Valley Community Advisory Committee - 24 Jun 2026</a></li></ol>
						</div>

					</div>
					<div style="display: inline-block; width: 95%; position: absolute; right: 10px; bottom: 10px;">
						<button id="ctl00_MainContent_MeetingTypeRepeater_ctl11_ApplyLink" type="button" title="Apply for a position on this board" class="button background-color-hover apply-button" data-meetingtype-id="22" data-tracker-id="35">Apply</button>
						
					</div>
					<input type="hidden" name="ctl00$MainContent$MeetingTypeRepeater$ctl11$MeetingTypePortalItemId" id="ctl00_MainContent_MeetingTypeRepeater_ctl11_MeetingTypePortalItemId" value="5420" />
				</div>
			
				<div id="ctl00_MainContent_MeetingTypeRepeater_ctl12_ItemTemplate" class="item-template">
